              "type": "custom-liquid",
              "name": "t:names.custom_liquid",
              "settings": {
                "custom_liquid": "<section class=\"ortheon-faq-section\">\n  <div class=\"ortheon-faq-container\">\n\n    <h2>Frequently Asked Questions</h2>\n\n    <div class=\"ortheon-faq-list\">\n\n      <details class=\"ortheon-faq-item\">\n        <summary>\n          <span class=\"ortheon-faq-icon\">⌾</span>\n          <span>How long does shipping take?</span>\n          <b>+</b>\n        </summary>\n        <p>Shipping usually takes 7–15 business days depending on your location.</p>\n      </details>\n\n      <details class=\"ortheon-faq-item\">\n        <summary>\n          <span class=\"ortheon-faq-icon\">⌾</span>\n          <span>What is your return policy?</span>\n          <b>+</b>\n        </summary>\n        <p>We offer hassle-free returns within 30 days of delivery.</p>\n      </details>\n\n      <details class=\"ortheon-faq-item\">\n        <summary>\n          <span class=\"ortheon-faq-icon\">⌾</span>\n          <span>How can I track my order?</span>\n          <b>+</b>\n        </summary>\n        <p>Once your order ships, you’ll receive a tracking link by email.</p>\n      </details>\n\n      <details class=\"ortheon-faq-item\">\n        <summary>\n          <span class=\"ortheon-faq-icon\">⌾</span>\n          <span>Do you ship internationally?</span>\n          <b>+</b>\n        </summary>\n        <p>Yes, we ship to selected international locations.</p>\n      </details>\n\n    </div>\n  </div>\n</section>\n\n<style>\n  .ortheon-faq-section {\n    background: #ffffff;\n    padding: 70px 24px;\n  }\n\n  .ortheon-faq-container {\n    max-width: 760px;\n    margin: 0 auto;\n  }\n\n  .ortheon-faq-container h2 {\n    font-size: clamp(30px, 4vw, 42px);\n    font-weight: 800;\n    color: #111827;\n    margin: 0 0 34px;\n  }\n\n  .ortheon-faq-list {\n    display: flex;\n    flex-direction: column;\n    gap: 12px;\n  }\n\n  .ortheon-faq-item {\n    border: 1px solid #dbe3e3;\n    border-radius: 12px;\n    background: #ffffff;\n    overflow: hidden;\n  }\n\n  .ortheon-faq-item summary {\n    list-style: none;\n    cursor: pointer;\n    padding: 18px 22px;\n    display: grid;\n    grid-template-columns: 38px 1fr auto;\n    align-items: center;\n    gap: 14px;\n    font-size: 19px;\n    font-weight: 700;\n    color: #111827;\n  }\n\n  .ortheon-faq-item summary::-webkit-details-marker {\n    display: none;\n  }\n\n  .ortheon-faq-icon {\n    width: 34px;\n    height: 34px;\n    background: #005b5c;\n    color: #ffffff;\n    border-radius: 50%;\n    display: inline-flex;\n    align-items: center;\n    justify-content: center;\n    font-size: 16px;\n  }\n\n  .ortheon-faq-item summary b {\n    font-size: 28px;\n    line-height: 1;\n    color: #005b5c;\n    font-weight: 500;\n  }\n\n  .ortheon-faq-item[open] summary b {\n    transform: rotate(45deg);\n  }\n\n  .ortheon-faq-item p {\n    margin: 0;\n    padding: 0 22px 20px 74px;\n    font-size: 15px;\n    line-height: 1.7;\n    color: #4b5563;\n  }\n\n  .ortheon-faq-link {\n    display: inline-flex;\n    margin-top: 28px;\n    color: #005b5c;\n    font-size: 18px;\n    font-weight: 800;\n    text-decoration: none;\n  }\n\n  @media (max-width: 600px) {\n    .ortheon-faq-section {\n      padding: 50px 18px;\n    }\n\n    .ortheon-faq-item summary {\n      padding: 16px;\n      grid-template-columns: 34px 1fr auto;\n      font-size: 16px;\n      gap: 10px;\n    }\n\n    .ortheon-faq-icon {\n      width: 30px;\n      height: 30px;\n      font-size: 14px;\n    }\n\n    .ortheon-faq-item p {\n      padding: 0 16px 18px 60px;\n    }\n  }\n</style>"
